{"cited_chunk_ids_snapshot":["cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed:p056:0053","cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed:p028:0016","cb_gongshou_practical_handbook_1ed:p016:0013","cb_koziol_2004_convertible_bonds_strategic_investors:p049:0062"],"cited_chunk_set_delta":{"added":["cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed:p056:0053","cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed:p028:0016","cb_gongshou_practical_handbook_1ed:p016:0013","cb_koziol_2004_convertible_bonds_strategic_investors:p049:0062"],"removed":[]},"event_checksum":"f9925c3efc3938138770152a6e7dc902ea6503f08a69cfe615413a770409506d","frontmatter_field_changes":["citations","id","reading_id","schema_version","summary","tags","title"],"frontmatter_snapshot":{"card_edges":[],"citations":[{"chunk_hash":"ab58d816a3237ef9b6edc4e3f0a0b4616556461fc8e667c80b68501676538b5a","chunk_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed:p028:0016","edge_type":"defines","page_range":[28,29],"quote":"只有惱尽办法让可转债持 有人转股，这些钱才能成为‚股东投资给自己的钱‛，丆市公司才能 斱便自由地使用。","source_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed"},{"chunk_hash":"000191f40939737ccb83cee8ebcf2be2dd1dd3a55c20aa569f74c387fe9e69f2","chunk_id":"cb_koziol_2004_convertible_bonds_strategic_investors:p049:0062","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[49,50],"quote":"If the conversion value is remarkably above the conversion price, i.e. the conversion probability is high, the value of a convertible bond is essentially driven by the firm value.","source_id":"cb_koziol_2004_convertible_bonds_strategic_investors"},{"chunk_hash":"38a73ca25817b531fe044eca5788b3a82daa8f95b0f22a9c4a6046ee30514180","chunk_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed:p056:0053","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[56,57],"quote":"换言之，“下调转股价”是一种权利，而不是义务。","source_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed"},{"chunk_hash":"0c90836e80f05cbf3fb35bd9baaf8875ff0e4989b6e6a20ba7e0a2b17c9e98ca","chunk_id":"cb_gongshou_practical_handbook_1ed:p016:0013","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[16,17],"quote":"为了确保下修议案能 顺利通过，控股股东往往会在拟下修前清仓可转债，这一点可作